003:l015","ordinal":215499,"en":"That's when Kanchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l016","ordinal":215500,"en":"Looking around,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l017","ordinal":215501,"en":"He just lost his soul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l018","ordinal":215502,"en":"Despite wandering around,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l019","ordinal":215503,"en":"Kylcha took her life,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l020","ordinal":215504,"en":"Koktelki in front"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l021","ordinal":215505,"en":"Whipping left and right,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l022","ordinal":215506,"en":"With the right hand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l023","ordinal":215507,"en":"Behind the dust,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l024","ordinal":215508,"en":"Red eyes like a lion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l025","ordinal":215509,"en":"That's enough, Kanchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l026","ordinal":215510,"en":"It reached before the arrow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l027","ordinal":215511,"en":"Golden collar"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l028","ordinal":215512,"en":"That's when Kanchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l029","ordinal":215513,"en":"He took the lead."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l030","ordinal":215514,"en":"He stopped and grabbed it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l031","ordinal":215515,"en":"A complete disbeliever,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l032","ordinal":215516,"en":"He is the hero Karagul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l033","ordinal":215517,"en":"A steel shield on your head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l034","ordinal":215518,"en":"He flew to the ground"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l035","ordinal":215519,"en":"A sharp sword from Er Chubak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l036","ordinal":215520,"en":"Unable to hold,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l037","ordinal":215521,"en":"Take it out of the bag,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b003:l038","ordina