id he saw it again and again."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l022","ordinal":215545,"en":"Karagul is dead—may the khan die!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l023","ordinal":215546,"en":"Don't pull back from Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l024","ordinal":215547,"en":"Otherwise, you all die!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l025","ordinal":215548,"en":"Turning to the Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l026","ordinal":215549,"en":"Lost from Karagul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l027","ordinal":215550,"en":"How to see Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l028","ordinal":215551,"en":"To the great khan in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0392:b004:l029","ordinal":215552,"en":"From soul to soul,"}]
